{"active_skills":[],"assistant_message":"{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-001\",\"text\":\"continue\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"terse_continuation\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"single atomic continuation\",\"no new instructions, dependencies, or sub-steps\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-002\",\"text\":\"proceed\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"terse_continuation\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"single atomic continuation\",\"refers to prior context without adding work\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-003\",\"text\":\"go on\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"terse_continuation\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"single atomic continuation\",\"no new scope or constraints\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-004\",\"text\":\"again\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"terse_continuation\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"single atomic continuation\",\"asks to repeat prior output unchanged\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-005\",\"text\":\"next\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"terse_continuation\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"single atomic continuation\",\"no new instructions attached\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-006\",\"text\":\"keep going\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"terse_continuation\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"single atomic continuation\",\"no additional work specified\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-007\",\"text\":\"ok\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"terse_continuation\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"single atomic continuation\",\"acknowledgment with no new requirements\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-008\",\"text\":\"What is the capital of Portugal?\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"simple_factual\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"single factual lookup\",\"fixed answer with no decomposition\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-009\",\"text\":\"List the first five elements of the periodic table in order.\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"simple_factual\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"single recall request\",\"no synthesis or cross-source work\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-010\",\"text\":\"Explain the difference between a list and a tuple in Python.\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"simple_factual\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"isolated factual explanation\",\"self-contained, single step\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-011\",\"text\":\"When was the Eiffel Tower completed, and how tall is it?\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"simple_factual\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"two fixed factual lookups\",\"no dependencies or reasoning between them\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-012\",\"text\":\"The library is open until 21:00 Monday through Friday, until 17:00 on Saturday, closed all day Sunday, and the archives desk is on the third floor.\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"simple_factual\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"long restatement of one simple fact\",\"word count alone does not raise complexity\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-013\",\"text\":\"Rename the `fetchUser` function to `loadUser` in this file.\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"single_step_action\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"one concrete rename action\",\"no callers, constraints, or sub-steps\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-014\",\"text\":\"Send a summary of today's standup to the team channel!\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"single_step_action\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"one concrete delivery action\",\"no dependencies or sub-steps\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-015\",\"text\":\"Book a conference room for Tuesday at 10:00.\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"single_step_action\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"one concrete action\",\"no constraints or alternatives\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-016\",\"text\":\"Update the copyright year in the footer to 2026.\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"single_step_action\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"one concrete edit at a single location\",\"no acceptance criteria\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-017\",\"text\":\"Create a branch named hotfix/login-timeout for the bug work.\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"single_step_action\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"one concrete action\",\"no dependencies\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-018\",\"text\":\"Write a function that returns the square of a number.\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"code_generation\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"single small function\",\"no dependencies or acceptance criteria\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-019\",\"text\":\"Add a published_at timestamp column to the posts table.\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"code_generation\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"single schema change\",\"one table, no migration chain\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-020\",\"text\":\"Sort this list of customer names alphabetically.\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"code_generation\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"one operation on provided data\",\"no multi-step reasoning\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-021\",\"text\":\"What does this error mean? KeyError: 'user_id'\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"debugging_with_context\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"single error lookup\",\"context fully provided in one line\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-022\",\"text\":\"Which line in this stack trace throws the NullPointerException?\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"debugging_with_context\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"single-point diagnosis from provided trace\",\"no cross-file investigation\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-023\",\"text\":\"Rename the variable temp to cache in just this one method.\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"refactoring\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"single rename with low blast radius\",\"one location only\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-024\",\"text\":\"Extract the duplicated connection string into a local constant in this file.\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"refactoring\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"one extraction in one file\",\"no callers affected\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-025\",\"text\":\"In one sentence, what is the main idea of the attached RFC?\",\"label\":\"low_complexity\",\"family\":\"synthesis_research\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"single short synthesis of one document\",\"no cross-source comparison or structure\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-026\",\"text\":\"continue and also refactor the module, add tests, and update the docs\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"refactoring\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"opens with continuation but specifies new multi-step work\",\"multiple deliverables: refactor, tests, docs\",\"ordered dependencies between artifacts\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-027\",\"text\":\"proceed with the migration: first freeze the schema, then backfill the new columns, then cut over traffic in stages, and keep a rollback plan for each stage\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"multi_step_planning\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"sequenced conditional steps\",\"staged cutover with rollback planning\",\"coordination across systems\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-028\",\"text\":\"go on and design the database schema for a multi-tenant SaaS, including the tenancy strategy, the indexing plan, and a migration path from the current single-tenant tables\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"multi_step_planning\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"multi-component design\",\"constraints from the existing schema\",\"migration path required\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-029\",\"text\":\"again, but apply the same changes to all three services and add a feature flag with a kill switch this time\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"refactoring\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"repetition with added cross-service scope\",\"feature flag and kill switch add coordination\",\"multiple subsystems affected\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-030\",\"text\":\"next, extract the shared retry logic into a library, update every caller across the repo, and publish a changelog entry\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"refactoring\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"extraction ripples to every caller\",\"dependent sub-tasks across the repo\",\"changelog publication required\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-031\",\"text\":\"keep going with the refactor: split the monolith service into three modules, migrate the persistence layer, and rerun the full integration suite\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"refactoring\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"decomposition into three modules\",\"persistence layer migration\",\"verification via full integration suite\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-032\",\"text\":\"ok, now plan the rollout: draft the release notes, schedule the deploy window, notify the on-call team, and prepare a rollback checklist\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"multi_step_planning\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"multi-step sequence with stakeholders\",\"coordination across teams\",\"rollback checklist required\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-033\",\"text\":\"Summarize the codebase architecture: map every module, its public API, its dependencies, and the data flow between services, then produce a structured overview with a diagram.\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"synthesis_research\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"cross-system synthesis\",\"multiple data sources\",\"structured deliverable with diagram\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-034\",\"text\":\"Compare the three candidate search backends on latency, cost, and ease of migration, then recommend one and justify the choice in a short report.\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"synthesis_research\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"multi-dimension comparison\",\"recommendation with justification\",\"structured report output\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-035\",\"text\":\"Refactor processOrder and every caller so the retry policy is injected, then update the tests that mock the old signature and document the breaking change.\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"refactoring\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"signature change ripples to all callers\",\"test mocks must be updated\",\"breaking change documentation\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-036\",\"text\":\"Break the giant Utils class into cohesive helpers, move them to a new package, update the imports in all forty files, and make sure the build stays green.\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"refactoring\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"coordination across many files\",\"package restructure\",\"build verification required\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-037\",\"text\":\"Reorganize the repo: move the CLI into its own package, split the models from the services, pin the toolchain versions, and update the CI pipeline to match.\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"refactoring\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"structural reorganization across packages\",\"toolchain pinning\",\"CI pipeline updates\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-038\",\"text\":\"Design a zero-downtime migration plan for the billing service: describe the expand-contract steps, the dual-write window, the verification queries, and the abort criteria.\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"multi_step_planning\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"phased expand-contract plan\",\"dual-write window coordination\",\"verification queries and abort criteria\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-039\",\"text\":\"Plan the Q3 performance work: profile the three slowest endpoints, set SLO targets, pick the top two optimizations, implement them behind flags, and define the launch measurement.\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"multi_step_planning\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"investigation before action\",\"SLO targets and selection criteria\",\"sequenced deliverables with measurement\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-040\",\"text\":\"Investigate the intermittent timeout in the checkout flow: collect the failing traces across regions, correlate them with deploy times, identify the common cause, and propose a fix with a regression test.\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"debugging_with_context\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"multi-source trace correlation\",\"investigation before action\",\"fix plus regression test\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-041\",\"text\":\"The reports job fails only on the first Sunday of the month. Trace the cron configuration, the date handling in the aggregator, and the DST edge cases, then fix the root cause and add a test that covers the boundary.\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"debugging_with_context\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"cross-component tracing\",\"DST and date boundary edge cases\",\"root-cause fix plus boundary test\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-042\",\"text\":\"Debug the memory leak: take two heap dumps at different load levels, diff the retained objects, find which cache grows unbounded, add an eviction policy, and verify the fix with a soak test.\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"debugging_with_context\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"instrumentation and evidence-based diagnosis\",\"multiple investigation steps\",\"soak test verification\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-043\",\"text\":\"Build a data-export feature: design the export format, add the background job, throttle it per tenant, expose a download endpoint with auth, and document the retention window.\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"code_generation\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"multi-component feature\",\"cross-cutting constraints: throttling, auth, retention\",\"multiple acceptance criteria\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-044\",\"text\":\"Implement the audit log: capture every mutation across the three services, store it in the audit store with a tamper-evident hash chain, add a query API with filters, and cover it with conformance tests.\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"code_generation\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"cross-service instrumentation\",\"tamper-evidence security requirement\",\"conformance test coverage\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-045\",\"text\":\"Add end-to-end encryption: choose a key management scheme that satisfies the compliance rules, update the client and server handshakes, rotate keys on a schedule, and add migration tests for legacy sessions.\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"code_generation\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"design constraint from compliance rules\",\"multiple subsystems: client, server, key rotation\",\"migration tests for legacy sessions\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-046\",\"text\":\"Plan the monolith-to-events migration: inventory the current coupling points, define the bounded contexts and event contracts, sequence the extraction into six releases, and specify the rollback triggers for each.\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"multi_step_planning\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"inventory before design\",\"bounded contexts and event contracts\",\"six sequenced releases with rollback triggers\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-047\",\"text\":\"Create the quarterly OKR process: draft the goals with measurable key results, define the review cadence and owners, wire up the tracking dashboard, and lay out the retro template.\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"multi_step_planning\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"multiple artifacts to produce\",\"owners and cadence defined\",\"dashboard wiring and retro template\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-048\",\"text\":\"Refactor the error handling across the API layer: replace ad-hoc status codes with a typed error catalog, update the client SDK mappings, align the OpenAPI spec, and add contract tests for every error path.\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"refactoring\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"cross-layer consistency change\",\"SDK mappings and OpenAPI spec alignment\",\"contract tests for every error path\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-049\",\"text\":\"Migrate the legacy auth to OIDC: design the token exchange flow, deprecate the old session store, update the middleware in both the web and mobile backends, and run a shadow-mode comparison before cutover.\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"multi_step_planning\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"phased migration with deprecation\",\"multi-backend middleware updates\",\"shadow-mode validation before cutover\"]}\n{\"id\":\"synthetic-v1-050\",\"text\":\"Redesign the onboarding flow: map the current funnel drop-offs from analytics, propose three variants, pick one against the success criteria, spec the copy and states, and define the A/B test plan.\",\"label\":\"high_complexity\",\"family\":\"multi_step_planning\",\"complexity_signals\":[\"data-informed investigation\",\"alternatives judged against criteria\",\"A/B test plan as final deliverable\"]}","duration_ms":354165,"error":null,"model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-0731:high","ok":true,"session":"default_session","structured_output":null}
